error: `syncData` on a file holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_sync_in_async.sg:4:16
 4 |     try writer.syncData()
   |                ^^^^^^^^
  hint: `await writer.syncDataAsync()` does the same work without holding the thread
